{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415012","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415012","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1041501201:1":{"text":"うーん、この薬草たちをどうしようかな。","source_cn":"哎呀，这些草药可怎么办呢。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4EFB49CD22F872F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041501202:0":{"text":"あんまり新鮮じゃないけど、安いからな……","source_cn":"虽然不太新鲜，但——但它便宜啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC105AF458EB21AAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041501203:1":{"text":"安い！？安い品はどこにあるんや！！！","source_cn":"便宜？！哪里有便宜货！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x83B4562D1677A891","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041501204:1":{"text":"おぉ、これかいな？ええやんか。","source_cn":"哦哦哦，就是这些吗？不错，不错。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1290B7AAF8ED2D68","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041501205:1":{"text":"なぁ兄ちゃん、ホンマの話、どれくらいまけてくれる？","source_cn":"那，老弟，你实话说，能便宜多少？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x629AC85BFD0F0D86","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041501206:1":{"text":"ちょっとお兄さん、この薬草はあっしがギリギリまで特別にとっておいた品なんですよ。割引きはあるっちゃありますが……","source_cn":"哎呀，老兄，不是我说，这些草药可是我特意留到最后的压箱...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA10C60BB8CA4539","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041501207:1":{"text":"じゃあ、九割引でどや！傷んでるし、売ってくれるか？","source_cn":"那么，算上折损和储存费用，就这个价吧：一折！你卖不卖？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x98476AFB67632149","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041501208:1":{"text":"ふふん、どうやらよーく話さなきゃいけないみたいですね。お兄さん、一緒に飲みませんか。","source_cn":"哼哼，看样子咱们得好好聊聊了，要不这样，老兄，咱们去喝一杯。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2657667429FF956","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041501209:1":{"text":"あっしは普段から、長期的に大量の薬草を提供できますよ。だからご要望があればなんなりと……価格は応相談ってことで。","source_cn":"我平时还能长期供货不少草药，你有什么要的，尽管跟我说…...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x571BE268D847AB5A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041501210:1":{"text":"大量注文で安くなるんか？ゴホン……ええなぁ。ほな、一杯行こか！今回はアンタのおごりや！","source_cn":"量大从优？咳嗯……不错啊。那，我们去喝一杯！这次你付账！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8A5656DBBA652262","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:阿德"